are genuine residents of the community."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq-item"},["H3",{},"Is there a cost to use ColonyCarpool?",["SPAN",{},"+"]],["DIV",{"class":"faq-answer"},["P",{},"Basic membership is free. We offer premium features like advanced matching and priority support through a optional subscription model. Ride costs are shared only between passengers and drivers."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq-item"},["H3",{},"How are ride costs calculated?",["SPAN",{},"+"]],["DIV",{"class":"faq-answer"},["P",{},"Costs are calculated based on distance, fuel prices, and vehicle type. Our algorithm suggests a fair cost that passengers can accept before confirming the ride."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq-item"},["H3",{},"What safety measures are in place?",["SPAN",{},"+"]],["DIV",{"class":"faq-answer"},["P",{},"We implement multiple safety features including ride tracking, emergency contact alerts, user ratings and reviews, and verified profiles. All rides are also insured through our partnership with leading insurers."]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"newsletter"},["DIV",{"class":"newsletter-content"},["H2",{},"Stay Updated"],["P",{},"Subscribe to our newsletter to get updates on new features and communities."],["FORM",{"class":"newsletter-form"},["INPUT",{"__playwright_value_":"","placeholder":"Enter your email address","required":"","type":"email","value":""}],["BUTTON",{"type":"submit"},"Subscribe"]]]],["FOOTER",{"class":"footer"},["DIV",{"class":"footer-container","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(50px);"},["DIV",{"class":"footer-brand"},["H2",{},"ColonyCarpool"],["P",{},"Making your daily commute stress-free, affordable, and eco-friendly. Together, we build a smarter community."],["DIV",{"class":"footer-socials"},["A",{"href":"#"},["svg",{"stroke":"currentColor","fill":"currentColor","stroke-width":"0","viewBox":"0 0 512 512","height":"1em","width":"1em","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"},["path",{"d":"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69